{"ref":"BDB, שַׁ֫חַל","hw":"שַׁ֫חַל","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁ֫חַל</span></big>  <strong>n.m. lion</strong> (poet.);—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 5:14\" href=\"/Hosea.5.14\">Ho 5:14</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁ֑חַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 4:10\" href=\"/Job.4.10\">Jb 4:10</a> +;—<em>lion</em>, sim. of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, toward Israel <a data-ref=\"Hosea 5:14\" href=\"/Hosea.5.14\">Ho 5:14</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּפִיר</span>), <a data-ref=\"Hosea 13:7\" href=\"/Hosea.13.7\">13:7</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נָמֵר</span>); of guilty men <a data-ref=\"Job 4:10\" href=\"/Job.4.10\">Jb 4:10</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְיֵה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּפִירִים</span>); fig. of foes <a data-ref=\"Psalms 91:13\" href=\"/Psalms.91.13\">ψ 91:13</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּפִיר</span>); <em>lion</em>, as hunted <a data-ref=\"Job 10:16\" href=\"/Job.10.16\">Jb 10:16</a> (in sim.); lit. <a data-ref=\"Job 28:8\" href=\"/Job.28.8\">28:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.13\">Pr 26:13</a>","next":"BDB, שְׁחֵ֫לֶת","prev":"BDB, שׁחל"}